date and place: April 16, 1914\\n\\nFather-in-law's name: Unknown\\n\\nFather-in-law's occupation: Born Ireland\\n\\nMother-in-law's name: Unknown\\n\\nMother-in-law's dates: Born Ireland\\n\\nSons: Richard \\\"Buddy\\\" (4/20/1915 - 1/5 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.rihs.org/mssinv/WomenGuide.htm\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"bfba0092efc2c402fa3b51832019449a0938c5065df649343ac3e3b792eccdf6\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"080ac7629367448feb180f215b5a3a6555858656bac254923e458c0c81dbc38a\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"born 1886 mistaken for shaman 1915 trip\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d4\"},\"ref\":\"d4\",\"snippet\":\" ... In the course of Christianity's coming to Korea and taking hold, it became mixed with shamanism, losing its essence and becoming distorted. In other words, the novel adopts a neutral perspective to criticize the negative way in which shamanism and Christianity have affected one another.\\n\\nFor this ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=133876\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... Terminology\\n\\nEtymology\\n\\nThe Modern English word shamanism derives from the Russian word , , which itself comes from the word from a Tungusic language – possibly from the southwestern dialect of the Evenki spoken by the Sym Evenki peoples, or from the Manchu language. The etymology of the word is sometimes ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shamanism\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"naviga