udents/article/Indigenous-peoples-of-the-Americas/275046\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... In several instances, songs related to shamanism are intended to imitate natural sounds, via onomatopoeia.\\n\\nSound mimesis in various cultures may serve other functions not necessarily related to shamanism: practical goals such as luring game in the hunt; or entertainment (Inuit throat singing).\\n\\nInitiation and learning\\n\\nShamans often ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shamanism\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"562820740f35dbdf127f8c904f197c0c9aa2c119fef3b12638eb61f2784bc22c\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"57100a522eb77956fcd97df65f2038a12db6b935dd7b423bf85c6826360e451d\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Diamond Jenness 1915 Copper Inuit shaman mistaken\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_b2bba3a2e9814ece9bde2f76"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d11\"},\"ref\":\"d11\",\"snippet\":\" ... After their honeymoon in New Zealand, Jenness set about writing up his Arctic reports, and produced eight government reports in five volumes, totaling 1,368 pages.Jenness, Diamond and Stuart E. Jenness, 2008. \\\"Through Darkening Spectacles: Memoirs of Diamond Jenness\\\" Mercury Series, History Paper 55, Gatineau, QC: Canadian ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diamond_Jenness\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navi